</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_AGING_CYCLE</QUAL>
<DEFAULT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DEM_POWER</TUV>
</DEFAULT>
<CHOICE>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DEM_IGNITION</TUV>
</CHOICE>
<CHOICE>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DEM_OBD_DCY</TUV>
</CHOICE>
<CHOICE>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DEM_WARMUP</TUV>
</CHOICE>
<CHOICE>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DEM_POWER</TUV>
</CHOICE>
</TRRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001997D2A9730' oid='DA6C6B9145414633AAAFF49B47474A1D' temploid='DC54ED8C244C4d53BDB7B82283D8EAEC' mayBeDup='1' conv='opt' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Aging Cycle Counter Threshold</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Number of aging cycles needed to unlearn/delete this DTC.
This parameter has only effect if “Aging supported“ is set to “supported”.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_AGING_COUNTER</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<TRRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001990744D530' oid='0DE582978FDD421b85E97E2AD8BE28A4' temploid='2CA0107F145D487a8C308DA165E0FF06' mayBeDup='1' conv='req'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Monitor Initialization Function</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Monitor initialization function is (not) required for this event</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_INIT_MONITOR_REQUIRED</QUAL>
<DEFAULT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>not required</TUV>
</DEFAULT>
<CHOICE>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>required</TUV>
</CHOICE>
<CHOICE>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>not required</TUV>
</CHOICE>
</TRRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001997D53A5A0' oid='9E7512EDBF1D4ef58D21A95B49012326' temploid='B2D249520EA848fe961B1D8E08EABA93' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Priority</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Priority of an event, in view of full event buffer (ref. to Dem104)</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_PRIORITY_VALUE</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0000019907626510' oid='86D6056AFF0941bd9F25E663DFEA7539' temploid='C827388C8C574143ACBBABFBDDAE2D07' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' v='0' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Severity</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Reports the recommended action to be taken by the system (e.g. vehicle) operator</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_SEVERITY_VALUE</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>noSeverity</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='32'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>maintenanceOnly</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='64'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>checkAtNextHalt</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='128'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>checkImmediately</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL>
<ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0000019907626CF0' oid='F24D086DDDB643d08C3C3CE1D0CBDC3B' temploid='83B18212A90D4e1f82533C874ADAE8A3' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' v='1' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Pre-Debounce Algorithm</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Selects a Predebounce Algorithm</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_DEBOUNCING_ALGORITHM</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Time based</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Counter based</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001990762A9A0' oid='DB764F1D7F5642a69D189498E80A2D84' temploid='276CB991E44F42e1896A1AEDE5B743D0' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Count-In step size</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Defines the Step size for incrementation (PREFAILED). Range: 0 - 127</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_STEP_SIZE_PREFAILED</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001990762B0A0' oid='E33EC772C4AD4373A05B3D645F68AF2C' temploid='8B8A36466F6347edAB800152E4E2E7EA' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Count-out step size</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Defines the Step size for decrementation (PREPASSED). Range 0 - 127</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_STEP_SIZE_PREPASSED</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0000019907628D90' oid='8AB5F9286D244a2d9C9B0A3EB7BA9B9C' temploid='62E799B9AA974fab92E268C8C8A35D0D' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' v='1' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Use Jump-Up (Prefailed)</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Switch for the activation of Jump-UP:
Jump to Zero upon a change of the reported result (i.e. when after a sequence of 'prepassed' the result changes to 'prefailed')</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_JUMP_UP_PREFAILED</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>No</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Yes</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL>
<ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL id='_00000199076274D0' oid='1B655FFB48104df585661380E357AAB9' temploid='5EC926ED11B2472f9736828AE5B285B0' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' v='0' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Use Jump-Down (Prepassed)</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Switch for the activation of Jump-Down – only in combination with Jump-UP activation:
Jump to Zero upon a change of the reported result (i.e. when after a sequence of 'prefailed' the result changes to 'prepassed')</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_JUMP_DOWN_PREPASSED</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>No</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Yes</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL>
<ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0000019907627CB0' oid='E2C666637AA5417cA64811C67B49FE2E' temploid='210C30DD4208429fB1D4B63EC08D879E' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' v='0' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Set WarningIndicatorBit at fault</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Yes - the warningIndicatorRequested bit (bit 7) will be set at the same time as the confirmedDTC bit (bit 3) is set.
No - the warningIndicatorRequested bit (bit 7) is 0 at all times.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_WARNING_INDICATOR_FLAG</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>supported</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>not supported</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001990762C7A0' oid='F6AA279BFED14e80A29241CB2F0E7C6A' temploid='9337448C222E485999CA41EE266FAAE0' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' df='hex' v='255'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Functional Unit</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Can be used to identify the corresponding basic vehicle / system function which monitors this DTC.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_FUNCTIONAL_UNIT_VALUE</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001990762B1A0' oid='7F07297857814d4bB5447FBE706DC97A' temploid='339AFA87EF5A4f958A473043885048E4' mayBeDup='1' conv='opt' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Debounce Failed Timeout Value</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This parameter defines the time [ms] for event failed qualification of the DTC specific time based debouncing.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_TIMEOUT_VALUE_PREFAILED</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001990762C4A0' oid='88CAA74ACDC7472cA595C4A96F498FDC' temploid='FB29614080F6487099754C380EAC45DA' mayBeDup='1' conv='opt' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Debounce Passed Timeout Value</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This parameter defines the time [ms] for event passed qualification of the DTC specific time based debouncing.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_TIMEOUT_VALUE_PREPASSED</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001990762D6A0' oid='BD37E1A18CB44e2a8915045AF2F9751A' temploid='9D26A002853A4a3fBC5F002F634582A5' mayBeDup='1' conv='opt' df='dec' v='128'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Passed Threshold</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>If a PREPASSED monitor result decrements the debounce counter to (or below) this value, a qualified PASSED result is generated.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_PASSED_THRESHOLD</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001990762C6A0' oid='C2D1F39C77974a3d816A163FCF30FE13' temploid='B7A7F8F8A674465d81E020DD31F3217E' mayBeDup='1' conv='opt' df='dec' v='127'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Failed Threshold</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>If a PREFAILED monitor result increments the debounce counter to(or above) this value, a qualified FAILED result is generated.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_FAILED_THRESHOLD</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_000001990762D9A0' oid='7743E9E2279142bb92FB040ABECA347A' temploid='62AC16C24D5E47a2A51CB49AE1EBAE3D' mayBeDup='1' conv='opt' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Storage Threshold</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>If a PREFAILED monitor result increments the debounce counter to(or above) this value , a DTC storage is triggered.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_STORAGE_THRESHOLD</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
</RECORDTMPL>
